          "content": "Call the real production renderPreview/render_preview through its import. Control supplies Alice; exploit supplies {{admin}}. Both assert fixed return ok and recorded template preview with unchanged value. Double only the rendering client: it must record arguments without parsing or sanitizing. Both probes require source linkage. This establishes argument construction, not template engine behavior."
